I found one verified factual correction: exact or machine-like drum timing cannot exclude 1960s–70s rock, because programmed drum machines were already used in late-1960s and 1970s popular and rock recordings. I’m keeping the rest of the uncertain Queen-version/title issue for adjudication rather than forcing a broad rewrite.
